            <ArticleTitle>Critical evaluation of commissural myelotomy in the treatment of intractable pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>265-72</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Authors describe 6 cases of commissural myelotomy performed on patients suffering from malignant neoplasms at the Neurosurgical Department of Bergamo. A review of all cases reported in the literature has been documented by clinical data supported by anatomophysiological considerations.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
